---
layout: base.njk
title: Who to pitch
description: "The companies worth your next email. Prospektor reads your website, finds companies that fit you and names who to write to."
stylesheet: /assets/css/tile-pages.css
# One page per language (#535, the same shape #114 gave the funnel) — see
# src/index.njk for the reasoning. Every sentence sits in a {% t %} block and
# renders untouched on the English page.
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: language
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ language.prefix }}/who-to-pitch/"
---

{#- #153, 24 Aug 2026: the first half of the product thesis, given a page of
    its own. #1092 (7 Oct 2026) put it in the studio's names. #1202 (7 Oct
    2026, the operator pointing at splitpay.com/mortgage) gave it that page's
    rhythm: a photo hero with product pieces on it, three steps, where the
    leads come from, the glance on a dark band, people and intros, short
    questions, and a close that repeats the headline. Styles in
    tile-pages.css, loaded here only.
    Every claim is in the studio's own help (docs/help/02-screens.md,
    03-pitches.md, 05-network.md). The names in the drawn pieces (Ledgerpost
    pitching Harborline and Calder) are invented example content, the same
    cast as the homepage tiles. One worked example and no scale: publish the
    method, never the mechanics (#746). -#}
{%- set ph = abtest.photos %}

<header class="tp-hero tp-who">
  <div class="tp-hero-in">
    <div>
      <h1 class="page-h1">{% t %}Who to pitch{% endt %}</h1>
      <p class="tp-display">{% t %}The companies worth your next email.{% endt %}</p>
      <p class="tp-lede">{% t %}Give it your website. It finds companies that fit you, scores each one and names who to write to.{% endt %}</p>
      <a class="btn-cta" href="{{ '/#scan' | localize }}">{% t %}Scan your site for free{% endt %}</a>
      <ul class="tp-ticks">
        <li>{% t %}No card, no sign-up to start{% endt %}</li>
        <li>{% t %}Three companies that fit, scored{% endt %}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- if ph.who %}
    <div class="tp-shot">
      <img src="{{ ph.who.src | asset }}" width="{{ ph.who.width }}" height="{{ ph.who.height }}" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="{% t %}A founder at a kitchen table, circling one name on a printed list{% endt %}">
      <div class="tp-chip tp-chip-a" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="tp-chip-t">{% t %}Leads for you{% endt %}</div>
        <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-lg tp-c1">B</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Brightwater Forwarding</b><span>{% t %}Like Northwind, one of your customers{% endt %}</span></span><span class="tp-fit tp-g">91</span></div>
        <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-lg tp-c2">C</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Calder Shipping Group</b><span>{% t %}Hiring a customs lead this month{% endt %}</span></span><span class="tp-fit tp-g">84</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-chip tp-chip-b" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="tp-chip-t">{% t %}Write to{% endt %}</div>
        <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-av tp-c4">M</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Marieke de Vries</b><span>{% t %}COO, Harborline{% endt %}</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</header>

<section class="tp-sec tp-white">
  <div class="tp-in">
    <div class="tp-sh">
      <h2>{% t %}From your website to a name to write to{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}Three steps, and the first one is free.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-steps">
      <div class="tp-step">
        <div class="tp-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tp-small">{% t %}Your company website{% endt %}</div>
          <div class="tp-field"><span>ledgerpost.com</span><span>{% t %}Find my leads{% endt %}</span></div>
        </div>
        <span class="tp-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Scan your site{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}It reads what you sell and works out who you should hunt for.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-step">
        <div class="tp-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tp-card">
            <div class="tp-rowh">{% t %}Like Northwind, one of your customers{% endt %}</div>
            <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-lg tp-c1">B</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Brightwater Forwarding</b><span>Rotterdam</span></span><span class="tp-fit tp-g">91</span></div>
            <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-lg tp-c4">K</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Kestrel Freight</b><span>Antwerp</span></span><span class="tp-fit tp-g">86</span></div>
            <div class="tp-lead"><span class="tp-lg tp-c3">T</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Talbot &amp; Vance Logistics</b><span>Felixstowe</span></span><span class="tp-fit">72</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="tp-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Read the shortlist{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Each lead sits in a row that says why it is there.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-step">
        <div class="tp-frame" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tp-card">
            <div class="tp-gh"><span class="tp-lg tp-c2">C</span><b>Calder Shipping Group</b><span class="tp-fit tp-g">84</span></div>
            <div class="tp-gline">{% t %}Nine people retype customs filings by hand, and they are hiring a tenth.{% endt %}</div>
            <div class="tp-roles"><span>{% t %}Head of Customs{% endt %}</span><span>COO</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="tp-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>{% t %}Glance at one{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}The fit, the one argument and who to write to.{% endt %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tp-sec">
  <div class="tp-in">
    <div class="tp-sh">
      <h2>{% t %}Three places your next customer hides{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}All three land on one list, best fit first.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    {%- if ph.learn %}
    <div class="tp-wide"><img src="{{ ph.learn.src | asset }}" width="{{ ph.learn.width }}" height="{{ ph.learn.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{% t %}A small team at a whiteboard, one ticking off a name{% endt %}"></div>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="tp-over{% if not ph.learn %} tp-over-flat{% endif %}">
      <div class="tp-oc">
        <div class="tp-ic tp-bg-who" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M9 1.8l2.2 4.6 5 .6-3.7 3.4 1 5-4.5-2.5-4.5 2.5 1-5L1.8 7l5-.6z" fill="#c8432c"/></svg></div>
        <h3>{% t %}Like your best customers{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Name a customer or a deal you closed. It finds more companies like them.{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="tp-eg" aria-hidden="true">{% t %}Like SplitPay, the deal you closed{% endt %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-oc">
        <div class="tp-ic tp-bg-learn" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M3 6h11M11 3l3 3-3 3M15 12H4M7 9l-3 3 3 3" stroke="#5b4bb7" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
        <h3>{% t %}Your competitors' clients{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}Counterprospekt finds who buys from your rivals, with the page that names each one.{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="tp-eg" aria-hidden="true">{% t %}A client of Botika, named on their case studies{% endt %}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-oc">
        <div class="tp-ic tp-bg-intro" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18"><path d="M4 4.5h10M4 9h10M4 13.5h6" stroke="#1e8e5a" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
        <h3>{% t %}Any list you paste{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}An exhibitor list or an investor's portfolio. Up to a hundred companies, each one scored.{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="tp-eg" aria-hidden="true">{% t %}Named on: Multimodal 2026 exhibitors{% endt %}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tp-sec tp-dark">
  <div class="tp-in">
    <div class="tp-sh">
      <h2>{% t %}One glance tells you if it's worth it{% endt %}</h2>
      <p>{% t %}Before you spend an hour on a company, spend fifteen seconds.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-glance" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="tp-score"><div><b>84</b><span>{% t %}Fit{% endt %}</span></div></div>
      <div>
        <div class="tp-gh"><span class="tp-lg tp-c2">C</span><b>Calder Shipping Group</b><span class="tp-tag">calder-shipping.com</span></div>
        <p class="tp-arg">{% t %}Nine people retype customs filings by hand, and their investor update names customs delay as the top drag on margin.{% endt %}</p>
        <div class="tp-sig">
          <div class="tp-for"><i>{% t %}For{% endt %}</i>{% t %}Hiring a customs lead this month{% endt %}<br>{% t %}Ships through 11 ports you already cover{% endt %}</div>
          <div class="tp-ag"><i>{% t %}Against{% endt %}</i>{% t %}Signed a two-year freight software deal in 2025{% endt %}</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tp-roles"><span>{% t %}Head of Customs{% endt %}</span><span>COO</span><span>{% t %}Finance Director{% endt %}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="tp-facts">
      <li><b>{% t %}About 15 seconds{% endt %}</b>{% t %}per company{% endt %}</li>
      <li><b>{% t %}One line{% endt %}</b>{% t %}the argument it rests on{% endt %}</li>
      <li><b>{% t %}Both sides{% endt %}</b>{% t %}signals for and against{% endt %}</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tp-sec tp-white" id="warm-intros">
  <div class="tp-in">
    <div class="tp-sh">
      <h2>{% t %}Then who to write to, and who can introduce you{% endt %}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-split">
      <div class="tp-pane tp-bg-who">
        <h3>{% t %}Decision-makers{% endt %}</h3>
        <p>{% t %}The people in those roles, with their LinkedIn and work email where one was found. A name comes only with a source behind it.{% endt %}</p>
        <div aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tp-person"><span class="tp-av tp-c4">M</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Marieke de Vries</b><span>{% t %}COO · LinkedIn · work email found{% endt %}</span></span><span class="tp-tag">{% t %}Write to{% endt %}</span></div>
          <div class="tp-person"><span class="tp-av tp-c2">J</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>Jonas Albers</b><span>{% t %}Head of Customs · LinkedIn{% endt %}</span></span></div>
          <div class="tp-person"><span class="tp-av tp-c7">?</span><span class="tp-nm"><b>{% t %}Finance Director{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}No name with a source behind it yet{% endt %}</span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tp-pane tp-photo-pane{% if not ph.intro %} tp-bg-intro{% endif %}">
        {%- if ph.intro %}
        <img src="{{ ph.intro.src | asset }}" width="{{ ph.intro.width }}" height="{{ ph.intro.height }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{% t %}Two people laughing over coffee, one showing the other a phone{% endt %}">
        {%- endif %}
        <div class="tp-chain">
          <h3>{% t %}Warm intros{% endt %}</h3>
          <p>{% t %}Who in your network can introduce you, and two drafts: your ask, and the email they send on.{% endt %}</p>
          <div class="tp-ch" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="tp-pp"><span class="tp-av tp-c6">Y</span><b>{% t %}You{% endt %}</b><span>Ledgerpost</span></div><span class="tp-arr">→</span>
            <div class="tp-pp"><span class="tp-av tp-c5">S</span><b>Sam Okafor</b><span>{% t %}Your old colleague{% endt %}</span></div><span class="tp-arr">→</span>
            <div class="tp-pp"><span class="tp-av tp-c4">M</span><b>Marieke de Vries</b><span>{% t %}COO, Harborline{% endt %}</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-drafted" aria-hidden="true">{% t %}Drafted: your ask to Sam, and the note to forward{% endt %}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tp-sec">
  <div class="tp-in">
    <div class="tp-sh"><h2>{% t %}Questions{% endt %}</h2></div>
    <div class="tp-faq">
      <details open><summary>{% t %}Is it free?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}The scan is: your site read, three companies that fit, scored, and who buys from one of your competitors. No card, no sign-up.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}What do I need to start?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Your website address.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Will it suggest a company I already sell to?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}No. A customer you name goes on your do-not-contact list and is never approached.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Where do the names and emails come from?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Public pages it read, each one linked. Without a source, a role stays a role.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Can I give it my own list?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Paste up to a hundred companies, or a page that lists them. Each one comes back scored.{% endt %}</p></details>
      <details><summary>{% t %}Can my team use it?{% endt %}</summary><p>{% t %}Yes. One workspace, your whole team, no seats to count.{% endt %}</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tp-close">
  <h2>{% t %}The companies worth your next email.{% endt %}</h2>
  <p>{% t %}Three of them, free, from your website.{% endt %}</p>
  <a class="btn-cta" href="{{ '/#scan' | localize }}">{% t %}Scan your site for free{% endt %}</a>
  <a class="tp-next tp-to-what" href="{{ '/what-to-send/' | localize }}">
    <div><b>{% t %}Found them? Now write to them.{% endt %}</b><span>{% t %}The deck, the one-pager, the cold email and the proposal, in your voice.{% endt %}</span></div>
    <em>{% t %}What to send →{% endt %}</em>
  </a>
</section>
